    "title": "Remake All Character Test Mod",
    "description": "This digital music mod is a test mod created by MadManToss for the beat battles Universe. It mainly aims to help check characters's voice and digital rhythm of top trending songs. However, you still can burn your Friday night via this game.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Press up, down, right, and left arrows to hear the voice of indie characters!\r\n- Enjoy all digital songs from full funky mods! Control timing under your fingertips!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Over 7 characters are available\r\n- Fantastic sound effects with stunning 2D images\r\n- Full series of background music from all original music mods\r\n- Super easy to play!\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nEnjoy your music night!\r\nHave fun!",
